Tabs of a notebook window: open, switch, reorder, close with the unsaved questions, reopen.

=== new and open add tabs at the end and activate them
new
open a.mcn
new
expect Untitled-1 a.mcn [Untitled-2]

=== opening an open file activates its tab
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open a.mcn
expect [a.mcn] b.mcn

=== next and previous wrap around
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
next
expect [a.mcn] b.mcn c.mcn
prev
expect a.mcn b.mcn [c.mcn]
prev
expect a.mcn [b.mcn] c.mcn

=== the n-th tab, and 9 is the last
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
nth 1
expect [a.mcn] b.mcn c.mcn
nth 2
expect a.mcn [b.mcn] c.mcn
nth 9
expect a.mcn b.mcn [c.mcn]
nth 7
expect a.mcn b.mcn [c.mcn]

=== moving keeps the active tab
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
select 0
move 0 2
expect b.mcn c.mcn [a.mcn]
move 1 0
expect c.mcn b.mcn [a.mcn]
move 2 0
expect [a.mcn] c.mcn b.mcn

=== closing the active tab activates the right neighbour, else the left one
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
select 1
close
expect a.mcn [c.mcn]
close
expect [a.mcn]
close
expect (none)

=== closing an inactive tab keeps the active one
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
close 0
expect b.mcn [c.mcn]

=== a modified tab asks first; cancel keeps it
open a.mcn
edit
close
expect [*a.mcn] ? a.mcn
answer cancel
expect [*a.mcn]

=== discard closes, saved closes
open a.mcn
edit
open b.mcn
edit
close
answer discard
expect [*a.mcn]
close
answer saved
expect (none)

=== close others asks for each modified tab in turn
open a.mcn
edit
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
edit
open d.mcn
select 1
close-others 1
expect *a.mcn [b.mcn] *c.mcn d.mcn ? a.mcn
answer discard
expect [b.mcn] *c.mcn d.mcn ? c.mcn
answer saved
expect [b.mcn]

=== cancel stops the remaining closes
open a.mcn
edit
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
edit
open d.mcn
select 1
close-others 1
expect *a.mcn [b.mcn] *c.mcn d.mcn ? a.mcn
answer cancel
expect *a.mcn [b.mcn] *c.mcn d.mcn

=== close to the right
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
open c.mcn
open d.mcn
close-right 1
expect a.mcn [b.mcn]

=== closing the window asks once for all modified tabs
open a.mcn
edit
open b.mcn
new
edit
close-window
expect *a.mcn b.mcn [*Untitled-1] ?all a.mcn,Untitled-1
answer cancel
expect *a.mcn b.mcn [*Untitled-1]
close-window
answer discard
expect *a.mcn b.mcn [*Untitled-1] !window

=== closing the window without changes asks nothing
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
close-window
expect a.mcn [b.mcn] !window

=== a saved tab closes without a question
open a.mcn
edit
save
close
expect (none)

=== reopen brings back the last closed files, newest first
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
new
open c.mcn
close 1
close 0
close
expect [Untitled-1]
reopen
expect Untitled-1 [c.mcn]
reopen
expect Untitled-1 c.mcn [a.mcn]
reopen
expect Untitled-1 c.mcn a.mcn [b.mcn]
reopen
expect Untitled-1 c.mcn a.mcn [b.mcn]

=== reopen skips files that are open again
open a.mcn
open b.mcn
close 0
open a.mcn
reopen
expect b.mcn [a.mcn]

=== untitled numbers keep counting
new
new
close
new
expect Untitled-1 [Untitled-3]

=== a file opened into the first blank tab gives its number back
new
openhere a.mcn
new
expect a.mcn [Untitled-1]
